# Keep LF in the repository and in Windows working copies. Prettier, Ruff, Linux CI and
# the PowerShell scripts all expect LF; core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite every
# file to CRLF on checkout and make `prettier --check` fail on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
